{"type":"entry","id":"cli.design_v0_1_landed","kind":"design","title":"anima CLI mk2 design v0.1 — 3-tier surface + 2가지 버전 통합","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["cli.cond.1"],"plan_doc":"docs/anima_cli_mk2_plan_2026_05_06.md","tier_design":{"T1_external_sales":{"commands":["anima","anima dialogue","anima onboard","anima --help","anima version"],"backend":"clm-v2-byte-18m-convo-5k (RECOVERED) OR Llama Path A v2 fallback","focus":"외부인 5초 가동, chat REPL"},"T2_internal_ops":{"commands":["anima ops <topic>"],"topics":26,"focus":"dev/maintainer surface"},"T3_consciousness_vision":{"commands":["anima connect/disconnect/module/verify/hub/laws/test"],"status":"미구현 v2.0 wire-up pending label","focus":"의식 surface (anima identity)"}},"falsifiers":["F-anima_cli-1: bin/anima ≤50 LoC (vs 352 mk1) + dispatch via anima_cli_mk2.spec.yaml","F-anima_cli-2: T1 default `anima` = chat REPL with backend connected","F-anima_cli-3: T2 26 ops accessible via `anima ops <topic>`","F-anima_cli-4: --help single-source (spec auto-generate)","F-anima_cli-5: T3 vision commands labeled 'v2.0 wire-up pending' (no command-not-found)"],"open_questions_resolved_default":{"Q1_default":"chat REPL (T1 sales surface)","Q2_backend":"clm-v2-byte-18m-convo-5k primary, Llama Path A v2 fallback (KO emit issue 별도 cycle)","Q3_T2_naming":"anima ops <topic>","Q4_T3_timeline":"v1.5 = clm-v2 connect / v2.0 = full 48 modules + verify + laws","Q5_dialogue_promote":"anima ≡ anima dialogue (alias)","Q6_spec_location":"anima/spec/anima_cli_mk2.spec.yaml 신규"},"honest_c3":["v1.0 vision wire-up (T3) 큰 작업 (1-2 weeks 추정) — v2.0 deferred","T2 surface naming 'anima ops <topic>' 결정 (alternative 'anima --ops <topic>' 또는 'aniops' 미선택)","clm-v2 KO emit 0/5 → T1 backend 결정 (anima-native vs Llama fallback) 별도 cycle","spec write only (raw#15 additive); bin/anima refactor 별도 cycle","mk2_apex consumer role — anima는 hive spec follow only, 자체 mk2 spec 추가는 anima/spec/ 내부"]}
