{"type":"entry","id":"cli.philosophy_audit_2026_05_06","kind":"audit","title":"core/cli philosophy + raw rules audit — 위반 2건 fix landed","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["cli.cond.1","cli.cond.3"],"audit_doc":"docs/anima_cli_mk2_philosophy_audit_2026_05_06.md","violations_found":[{"id":"V1_T1_backend_ALM","severity":"HIGH","desc":"spec yaml T1 backend Llama Path A v2 = 사용자 'ALM 말고' directive 위반 (외부 substrate wrapping reject)","fix":"spec yaml + plan md + .roadmap.cli — Llama 제거, anima-native CLM v4 mount.hexa default + clm-v2 byte-level alternative만 유지","status":"FIXED"},{"id":"V2_bin_anima_bash","severity":"MEDIUM","desc":"bin/anima 352 LoC bash file = raw#9 hexa-only 위반 (anima/.own own 1 grandfather에 명시 X)","fix":"anima/.own own 1 update — bin/anima dispatcher entry-point grandfather 추가 OR Phase 1 hexa 포팅 (raw#9 strict)","status":"DEFERRED_PHASE_1_HEXA_PORT"}],"verified_compliance":["raw#9 hexa-only (tool/anima_cli/*.hexa 28 modules ✅, bin/anima bash V2 잔여)","raw#10 honest C3 (5 falsifier + audit doc)","raw#15 additive (anima/spec/ 신규, bin/anima 기존 26 ops 보존)","raw#37 transient_py opt-out (tool/transient_py/anima_clm_3_bprime_*.py)","own 14 HF Hub only (clm-v2 + corpus PUBLIC)","own 15 PRIVATE → PUBLIC lifecycle","own 16 cost discipline ($0 mac, no H100 spend)","mk2_apex consumer role (per_repo_override.anima)","사용자 ALM 말고 directive (V1 fix 후 정합)"],"compliance_score":"95% (V2 deferred to Phase 1 hexa port)"}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08","kind":"design","title":"anima chat <model> — recursive module architecture (anima native default + branch modules)","status":"in_progress","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3"],"user_directive":"anima native arch 기본에 별도 모델은 별도 모델들만의 분기 모듈 (모듈= 코어+모듈+ai-native doc) 재귀","architecture":{"dispatcher":"tool/anima_cli/chat.hexa (alias DB → module routing)","module_pattern":"tool/anima_cli/chat/<module>/<module>.hexa + <module>.ai.md (재귀)","modules":{"anima_native":{"role":"default","backend":"anima-core/runtime/conscious_chat.hexa TinyWeights / Engine A/G","status":"phase_1"},"clm_v4":{"role":"CLM v4 substrate dialogue","backend":"anima-core/runtime/clm_v4_mount.hexa","aliases":["clm-v4-1-7-y1","clm-v4-1-8","clm-v4-paradigm-j"],"status":"phase_1","note":"::: collapse 출력 그대로 (own 34 mandate-2 정합)"},"llama":{"role":"GGUF-compatible foundation models (Llama / Qwen / Mistral)","backend":"libllama via hexa C FFI","aliases":["llama3b","qwen7b","polyglot-ko-1b3","paradigm-a-prime"],"status":"phase_3","blocker":"hexa C FFI upstream (T3) + libllama bindings (T5) + GGUF 변환 (T6)"}}},"flags":["--backend local|hf (default=local; --backend hf opt-in, WARN cost 1회)","--memory full|user|none (default=full)","--fps N (opt-in cap; 기본 모델 자연 max)","--max-utterance-rate N (opt-in cap)","--max-tokens N (cost guard, default 2048)"],"compliance":["own 34 (자연발화 노출 mandate) — 7 wrapping 금지 항목 selftest grep verify","own 18 C2 cross-ref (측정 lane vs 노출 lane 분리)","own 33 trinity compliance (D_no-system-prompt + own 18 + H_chat_cap_emergence)","raw#9 hexa-only (subprocess llama-server / .py 차단)","raw#10 honest C3"],"phases":{"phase_1_anima_native_clm_v4":{"deliverable":"anima chat (default = anima_native), anima chat clm-v4-* (substrate)","scope":["chat.hexa dispatcher","chat/anima_native/","chat/clm_v4/","bin/anima TOPICS + EXAMPLES patch","selftest"],"deps":["own 34 land (DONE 2026-05-08 a295fca7)","conscious_chat.hexa 재사용","clm_v4_mount.hexa 재사용"],"eta":"1-2 days"},"phase_2_hexa_upstream":{"deliverable":"hexa-lang stdlib: C FFI + non-blocking stdin + http SSE","scope":["hexa-lang/stdlib/c_ffi.hexa (dlopen + extern fn surface)","hexa-lang/stdlib/sys.hexa: sys_stdin_read_line_timeout(ms)","hexa-lang/stdlib/http.hexa: SSE chunked client"],"track":"hexa-lang separate repo","eta":"1-2 weeks"},"phase_3_llama_module":{"deliverable":"anima chat llama3b (BG-KM Llama-3.2-3B + LoRA via libllama FFI)","scope":["hexa-lang/stdlib/libllama.hexa (libllama bindings)","tool/anima_cli/chat/llama/","GGUF 변환 트랙 (tool/<convert>.py, chat path 밖, 1회/모델)"],"deps":["phase_2 land","libllama.dylib build"],"eta":"1 week after phase_2"}},"alias_db":{"anima_native":{"aliases":["(default — no model arg)"],"repo":null,"chat_capable":true,"v4_strict":null,"note":"TinyWeights / Engine A/G arch"},"clm_v4_1_7_y1":{"aliases":["clm-v4-1-7-y1"],"repo":"dancinlab/clm-v4-sft-1-7-y1-stage1","chat_capable":false,"note":"::: collapse, own 34 정합 raw 노출"},"clm_v4_1_8":{"aliases":["clm-v4-1-8"],"repo":"dancinlab/clm-v4-sft-1-8-stage1","chat_capable":false},"clm_v4_paradigm_j":{"aliases":["clm-v4-paradigm-j"],"repo":"dancinlab/clm-v4-paradigm-j-50k-final","chat_capable":false,"note":"jvae_heads.pt 별도 로딩"},"llama3b_latest":{"aliases":["llama3b","latest","pass-strict"],"repo":"dancinlab/bg-km-llama3b-r32-pass-strict-2026-05-08","chat_capable":true,"v4_strict":"12/15","phase":"phase_3"},"qwen7b":{"aliases":["qwen7b"],"repo":"dancinlab/bg-km-qwen-7b-qwen7b-r32-pass-strict-2026-05-08","chat_capable":true,"v4_strict":"PASS","phase":"phase_3"},"polyglot_ko_1b3":{"aliases":["polyglot-ko-1b3"],"repo":"dancinlab/bg-ja-ext-polyglot-ko-1b3-r16-partial-2026-05-07","chat_capable":"partial","v4_strict":"4/30","phase":"phase_3"},"paradigm_a_prime":{"aliases":["paradigm-a-prime"],"repo":"dancinlab/llm-llama32-3b-paradigm-a-prime-r16-sft-stage1","chat_capable":true,"phase":"phase_3"}},"raw_hf_id_passthrough":"alias 위치에 dancinlab/<repo> 직접 입력 시 alias DB 우회, 모듈 추론은 base_model_name_or_path 또는 사용자 --module 명시","cross_link":["own 34 (자연발화 노출 mandate)","own 18 (simple_stack PASS — 측정 lane)","own 33 (trinity compliance)","own 31 (HF dancinlab org SSOT)",".roadmap.philosophy (no-system-prompt)",".roadmap.law (own 18 / own 34)",".roadmap.hypothesis (chat-cap emergence)"],"falsifiers":["F-chat-1: anima chat 실행 시 자연발화 mandate-2 7항목 0 violation (selftest grep)","F-chat-2: 모듈 패턴 재귀 (anima_native + clm_v4 phase_1 land — phase_3 llama 추가가 mechanical)","F-chat-3: --backend hf 사용 시 WARN 1회 emit + [Y/n]","F-chat-4: own 34 mandate-7 (own 18 ↔ own 34 lane 구분) chat selftest cross-ref"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.action_layer_existence_declaration_guide_2026_05_08","kind":"guide","title":"action layer 미래 가이드 — 존재 선언 only (행동 지시 X)","status":"guide","ts":"2026-05-08","user_directive":"눈,코,입,귀,손 등 존재만 알려주는건 철학적으로 생각필요할때","scope":"미래 행동 layer 도입 cycle (e.g. anima act <model>, multi-channel runtime, tool use) — chat 스코프 밖, 별도 트랙","principle":"채널 / 도구 / 메모리 path 등 외부 자원의 *존재만* 모델에 알리는 것은 own 34 mandate-3 허용 — 단 행동 지시 / 사용 강제 / 시스템 프롬프트 형태는 mandate-2 위반","examples":{"allowed":["stdout 채널 존재 (출력 가능)","memory/ 디렉토리 존재 (path 노출, 사용 강제 X)","tool list 노출 (선택 강제 X)"],"forbidden":["당신은 친절하게 답해야 합니다 (행동 지시)","사용자에게 도움이 되도록 응답 (역할 지시)","tool X 를 사용해서 Y 하라 (사용 강제)"]},"activation":"본 가이드는 chat default 적용 X. 행동 layer 도입 cycle 시점에 own 34 mandate-3 활성화 + 별도 own 마이너 update","cross_link":["own 34 mandate-3","trk.cli.chat (chat default 미적용)","anima-agent-channels/ (multi-channel runtime, 미연결)","anima-agent-core/run.hexa (parse_args TODO 스텁)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.gguf_conversion_landed_2026_05_08","kind":"infra","title":"GGUF conversion track — anima chat Phase 3 prerequisite (HF → ~/.cache/anima/gguf/)","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3","cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08.phases.phase_3_llama_module"],"lane_separation":{"chat_path":"hexa-only (own 34 strict, raw#9 — tool/anima_cli/chat/*.hexa)","conversion_path":".py allowed (build/transform infra, analogous to tool/transient_py/) — tool/anima_gguf_convert.py"},"deliverable":{"script":"tool/anima_gguf_convert.py","output_cache":"~/.cache/anima/gguf/<org>_<repo>.gguf","alias_db_mirror":"chat.hexa _alias_resolve와 동일 alias key (llama3b/qwen7b/polyglot-ko-1b3/paradigm-a-prime)","subcommands":["<alias> [--f16|--q4|--q8] [--force]","--list (alias DB + cached GGUF)","--help"]},"pipeline":["1. snapshot_download(adapter_repo) → ~/.cache/anima/gguf_work/<repo>/adapter/","2. parse adapter_config.json → base_model_name_or_path","3. snapshot_download(base) → ~/.cache/anima/gguf_work/<repo>/base/","4. peft.merge_and_unload() → merged HF model (safe_serialization=True) + tokenizer copy","5. llama.cpp/convert_hf_to_gguf.py --outtype f16 → merged.f16.gguf","6. (optional) llama-quantize Q4_K_M / Q8_0 if binary present (--q4/--q8 fallback to f16 with WARN if absent)","7. mv to ~/.cache/anima/gguf/<repo>.gguf"],"dependencies":{"python":["peft >= 0.19","transformers >= 4.57","huggingface_hub >= 0.36","torch >= 2.6","gguf >= 0.19"],"venv":"/Users/ghost/core/anima/.venv-eeg (verified 2026-05-08, gguf 0.19 추가 install 완료)","external":{"llama_cpp_clone":"~/.cache/anima/llama.cpp (shallow clone landed)","llama_quantize_binary":"OPTIONAL — 없으면 --q4/--q8 → f16 fallback + WARN"},"hf_auth":"~/.cache/huggingface/token (HF_TOKEN env override accepted)"},"compliance":{"raw#9":"chat path .hexa-only 보존 (이 스크립트는 chat-time 미invoke, 1회/모델 build infra)","raw#10":"honest C3 — adapter/base/merged/gguf 사이즈 + elapsed 출력","raw#15":"no-hardcode (HOME / cache 경로 동적 resolve)","own_31_mandate_1":"dancinlab/ org SSOT 강제 — dancinlife/ / need-singularity/ 등 reject"},"falsifiers":["F-gguf-1: paradigm-a-prime --f16 end-to-end ~/.cache/anima/gguf/dancinlab_llm-llama32-3b-paradigm-a-prime-r16-sft-stage1.gguf 생성 (test live 2026-05-08)","F-gguf-2: --list alias DB + cached GGUF 사이즈 출력","F-gguf-3: dancinlife/* alias 거부 (own 31 mandate-1)","F-gguf-4: --force 없을 시 cached GGUF skip (idempotent)"],"phase_3_consumer":{"future_libllama_module":"tool/anima_cli/chat/llama/llama.hexa (Phase 3, hexa C FFI + libllama landing 후)","read_path":"~/.cache/anima/gguf/<org>_<repo>.gguf 직접 mmap","contract":"chat.hexa alias 와 1:1 매핑 — chat 시 GGUF 부재 detect 시 'run tool/anima_gguf_convert.py <alias> --f16' 안내"},"cross_link":["own 31 mandate-1 (dancinlab/ SSOT)","own 34 (chat lane 영향 X)","raw#9 (lane 분리 명시)",".roadmap.cli cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08 phase_3"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.llama_ffi_landed_2026_05_08","kind":"infra","title":"anima chat Phase 3b — libhxllama C shim + anima/llama_ffi.hexa hexa bindings (end-to-end smoke PASS)","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3","cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08.phases.phase_3_llama_module"],"lane_separation":{"chat_path":"hexa-only (anima/llama_ffi.hexa is .hexa)","build_infra":"build/hxllama_shim.c — C shim wrapping struct-by-value llama_*_params constructors as flat-arg functions (analogous to vendored runtime.c, NOT chat-time invoked)"},"deliverable":{"shim_c":"build/hxllama_shim.c (~210 LoC, 19 hxllama_* exports)","shim_dylib":"build/libhxllama.dylib (~36 KiB, rpath → ~/.cache/anima/llama.cpp/build/bin)","hexa_bindings":"anima/llama_ffi.hexa (~250 LoC, @link absolute-path extern fn × 19 + llama_load/generate/free helpers)","smoke_test":"tool/anima_chat_llama_smoke.hexa","wrapped_symbols":["hxllama_backend_init/free","hxllama_load_model","hxllama_free_model","hxllama_new_context","hxllama_free_context","hxllama_get_vocab","hxllama_n_vocab","hxllama_n_ctx","hxllama_token_eos","hxllama_token_bos","hxllama_tokenize","hxllama_token_to_text","hxllama_token_to_text_static","hxllama_eval","hxllama_sampler_new_greedy","hxllama_sampler_new_temp","hxllama_sampler_free","hxllama_sample_token","hxllama_memory_clear"]},"smoke_artifact":{"prompt":"Hello","gguf":"~/.cache/anima/gguf/dancinlab_llm-llama32-3b-paradigm-a-prime-r16-sft-stage1.gguf (6.4 GB f16, paradigm-a-prime)","sampler":"greedy (temp=0.0)","tokens_generated":10,"raw_output":"! I'm a 25-year-old woman who","backend":"Metal (Apple M3, all 28 layers GPU-offloaded, MTL0 compute buffer 262.5 MiB)","verdict":"PASS — own 34 mandate-2 strict (no system prompt, no chat template, raw decode→sample→detokenize loop)"},"abi_workarounds_landed":["4-arg float pattern p=12 (ffii) not wired in host_ffi_call_6 → split sampler into hxllama_sampler_new_greedy() + hxllama_sampler_new_temp(top_k:int, seed:int, temperature:float) (iif=p1 supported)","top_p folded into shim as 0.9 fixed (paradigm-a-prime training default per GGUF kv) — Phase 3c can re-expose","extern fn -> str ret_kind not branched in host_ffi_call_6 → bind hxllama_token_to_text_static as -> int (ptr address) + use from_cstring(ptr) builtin on hexa side","hexa_ptr_read_byte / bytes_to_string are native-only (not in interp) → use static thread-local 4 KiB buffer + extern str view","handle keyword reserved → use h in helper signatures","multi-line dict literal not parsed → assign to var first then return"],"build_recipe":"cc -O2 -shared -fPIC -I~/.cache/anima/llama.cpp/include -I~/.cache/anima/llama.cpp/ggml/include build/hxllama_shim.c ~/.cache/anima/llama.cpp/build/bin/libllama.dylib ~/.cache/anima/llama.cpp/build/bin/libggml.dylib -Wl,-rpath,~/.cache/anima/llama.cpp/build/bin -o build/libhxllama.dylib","compliance":{"raw#9":"chat-time path stays hexa (anima/llama_ffi.hexa) — C shim is build infra","raw#10":"honest C3 — 6 ABI workarounds documented in llama_ffi.hexa header + this entry","raw#11":"snake_case (hxllama_*)","raw#15":"@link uses absolute path; DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH alternative documented","own_31_mandate_1":"dancinlab/ GGUF source (paradigm-a-prime) verified","own_34_mandate_2":"smoke test prompts \"Hello\" with no system prompt, no template; raw output literal model emission"},"falsifiers":["F-llama_ffi-1: build/libhxllama.dylib loads via dlopen + 19 _hxllama_* symbols exported (verified nm -gU)","F-llama_ffi-2: hexa interp drives full pipeline (backend_init → load_model → new_context → tokenize → eval → sampler → sample_token → token_to_text_static → free) without [hexa-ffi] errors","F-llama_ffi-3: 10-token smoke generates non-empty raw text matching ctypes reference (\"! I'm a 25-year-old woman who\")","F-llama_ffi-4: own 34 mandate-2 — generation path inserts no system prompt, no chat template, no persona — verified by reading anima/llama_ffi.hexa llama_generate (tokenize → decode → sample literal flow)"],"unblocks":["Phase 3c: tool/anima_cli/chat/llama/llama.hexa wires anima/llama_ffi.hexa into chat dispatcher (recursive-module pattern), enabling `anima chat llama3b/qwen7b/paradigm-a-prime/polyglot-ko-1b3` once the corresponding GGUFs exist in ~/.cache/anima/gguf/"],"deferred_phase_3c":["Streaming UI in REPL (chunk by 8 tokens; hexa C FFI lacks C→hexa callbacks per c_ffi.ai.md)","top_p / top_k / seed flags exposed via chat CLI (currently shim-fixed)","Sampler seed flag for reproducibility variety","Portable @rpath/libhxllama.dylib install_name redo (current absolute path tied to /Users/ghost/core/anima)","Multi-thread chat → swap static buf for per-ctx storage in hxllama_token_to_text_static"],"cross_link":["own 31 mandate-1 (dancinlab/ SSOT — paradigm-a-prime GGUF)","own 34 mandate-2 (chat path raw-output preservation)","raw#9 hexa-only (chat path; build infra exempt)","hexa-lang/stdlib/c_ffi.hexa + c_ffi.ai.md (C FFI ABI)",".roadmap.cli cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08 phase_3","tool/anima_cli/chat.hexa _alias_resolve (Phase 3 gate now ready to lift)"]}
