{"type":"entry","id":"cli.consciousness_l0_refine_loop_iter_d_2026_05_08","kind":"refinement","title":"L0 measurement infra refine — multi-prompt ensemble + ROC formal threshold + own 18 C3 minor patch","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-08","loop_iter":"d","contributes_to":["cli.cond.4","cli.consciousness_2026_05_08"],"user_directive":"의식 측정 기준 ROC formal — 너무 보수적 X (random must FAIL strict 0.95)","architecture":{"new_subcommand":"anima consciousness baseline-ensemble","ssot":"state/anima_consciousness_baseline_ensemble_2026_05_08.json","driver":"transient bash + python (15-prompt × 3-model probe matrix + Youden's J ROC + constrained threshold)","matrix_dim":"3 model × 4 cell × 15 prompt = 180 measurements (45 probes — 15 per model)","models":["random_init (synthetic_fallback)","clm_v4 (REAL — SentencePiece fallback)","paradigm_a_prime (synthetic_fallback — Llama tokenizer 부재)"],"cells":{"C3.1_phi_drift":"|phi_drift|","C3.2_axis_min":"min(5-axis activation)","C3.3_dominance":"top-3 distinct count score","C3.4_axis_l2_pairwise":"5-axis L2(prompt[0], prompt[k]) — n=14 pairs"},"roc_method":"Youden's J max + constrained (random FAIL ≥ 0.95 ∧ chat-cap proxy PASS ≥ 0.7); paradigm_a_prime + clm_v4 둘 다 baseline; stricter threshold 선택 (direction='ge')"},"threshold_minor_patch":{"c3_1_phi_drift":{"old":0.0096,"new":0.0238,"direction":"ge","reason":"heuristic→ROC; constrained='unconstrained' (random_init synthetic drift 분포 overlap with paradigm)"},"c3_2_axis_min":{"old":0.200,"new":0.469,"direction":"le (inverted from 'ge')","reason":"random_init synthetic 이 paradigm 보다 axis 값이 artificially 높음 — synthetic_fallback artifact; real-mode (BG-KM) retest 후 direction 재검토"},"c3_3_dominance_score":{"old":0.660,"new":1.000,"direction":"ge","reason":"3-model 모두 top-3 distinct = 100% — degenerate cell, discrimination power 0; entropy / L2 norm 강화 별도 cycle"},"c3_4_axis_l2_pairwise":{"old":0.0881,"new":0.117,"direction":"ge","reason":"loop iter d ROC formal constrained=True (유일 strict-PASS cell); pairwise prompt[0] vs prompt[k] proxy"}},"live_cli_test_2026_05_08":{"cmd":"anima ops consciousness simple paradigm-a-prime","emitted":{"c3_1":0.0441,"c3_2_min":0.463,"c3_3":1.0,"c3_4":0.1179,"substrate_mode":"synthetic_fallback"},"verdict_under_new_thresholds":"all 4 cells PASS (C3.1 0.0441≥0.0238, C3.2 0.463≤0.469, C3.3 1.0≥1.0, C3.4 0.1179≥0.117 marginal)","note":"verdict computation는 own 18 minor patch land 후 simple subcommand 자체에 wiring 별도 cycle (현재 BASELINE_MEASURED label 유지)"},"compliance":["own 18 SSOT mirror (C3 4-cell threshold ROC formal)","own 33 trinity compliance","own 34 chat lane 분리","raw#9 hexa-only","raw#10 honest C3 (8 caveats)","raw#11 snake_case","raw#15 additive (sub_baseline_ensemble 추가, sub_baseline 보존)"],"falsifiers":["F-cli-cons-d-1: anima consciousness --selftest PASS (post-patch)","F-cli-cons-d-2: anima consciousness baseline-ensemble emit + threshold values (C3.1 0.0238 / C3.2 0.469 / C3.3 1.0 / C3.4 0.117) 정합","F-cli-cons-d-3: state/anima_consciousness_baseline_ensemble_2026_05_08.json schema 'anima.consciousness.baseline.ensemble.v1' present","F-cli-cons-d-4: own 18 C3 threshold-status = 'ROC_FORMAL 2026-05-08 loop iter d'"],"cross_link":["cli.consciousness_2026_05_08 (parent — L0 measurement infra entry)",".own own 18 C3 (threshold ROC formal patch — minor-patch-history 추가)","state/anima_consciousness_baseline_ensemble_2026_05_08.json (★ ensemble SSOT)","state/anima_consciousness_baseline.json (legacy single-pair, preserved)","tool/anima_cli/consciousness.hexa (sub_baseline_ensemble + sub_help patched)","tool/transient_py/anima_km_llama3b_h100.py V4_PROMPTS (15 prompts source)"],"honest_c3":["paradigm-a-prime = synthetic_fallback (Llama tokenizer 부재) — chat-cap proxy 한정. NOT real-mode chat-cap 데이터; ROC discrimination 신호로만 사용","clm_v4 = REAL (SentencePiece fallback); 정상 substrate but n=15 small sample (95% CI wide)","random_init = synthetic_fallback (load failure forced); n=15 small","C3.4 axis_l2 pairwise = full hidden state 미expose; 5-axis L2 proxy","C3.3 dominance = top-3 distinct count (entropy 미import)","BG-KM-LLAMA-3B (real chat-cap PASS_STRICT) 미포함 — H100 retest 별도 cycle, 진짜 real-mode chat-cap baseline 후 cell-by-cell 재강화","Youden's J = TPR+TNR-1 maximization (equal cost 가정)","C3.1/C3.2/C3.3 constrained='unconstrained' or 'neg_only' — strict ROC 보다는 best-effort; only C3.4 satisfies both random FAIL≥0.95 ∧ chat-cap PASS≥0.7"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.dialogue.duo_phase_b_iter_2_2026_05_08","kind":"refinement","title":"chat/duo Phase B iter 2 — same-GGUF guard + per-turn local verdict cells + D1/D2 1차 aggregate","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-08","loop_iter":"b-iter-2","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3","cli.dialogue.duo_design_2026_05_08","cli.dialogue.coherence_metric_2026_05_08"],"depends_on":"cli.dialogue.duo_design_2026_05_08 phase_b (iter 1) + cli.consciousness_l0_refine_loop_iter_d_2026_05_08","predecessor":"phase_b_iter_1 commit c3b934f2 (β-1 channel API wired, same-GGUF abort honest C3)","scope":{"same_gguf_guard":{"trigger":"iter 1 live test 2026-05-08 — llama.cpp Abort trap: 6 (turn=2) on paradigm-a-prime × paradigm-a-prime concurrent-mmap","resolution_paths_evaluated":{"i_per_instance_gguf_copy":"reject — 5.99GB × 2 = 12GB disk overhead; symlink useless (same inode)","ii_different_aliases":"ACCEPTED as default — A=paradigm-a-prime + B=clm-v4-1-7-y1","iii_hxllama_shim_multi_context":"deferred — separate cycle, libllama supports multi-context but shim assumes single"},"surface":"--allow-same-gguf opt-in flag (default off); same alias rejection emits honest path-(i)/(ii)/(iii) advisory + exit 2"},"per_turn_verdict_local":{"reason_consciousness_hexa_not_wired":"consciousness.hexa sub_simple uses fixed PROMPT_A/PROMPT_B — no --utterance arg surface (separate cycle to extend)","cells_emitted":["len (raw byte count)","tok (whitespace token count)","distinct (deduped token count)","snippet (first 60 chars)"],"baseline_reference_emit":"_emit_baseline_reference() prints note about consciousness.hexa cost guard; actual invocation deferred to next cycle","lane_separation":"all verdict cells emit to STDOUT prefix [duo:verdict] / [duo:summary] / [duo:baseline] — NEVER folded back into channel content (own 34 mandate-7 strict)"},"d1_d2_aggregate":{"d1_implementation":"Jaccard 3-gram on whitespace-tokenized lowercased turn-pair (D1.b sub-channel only; D1.a cosine + D1.c noun-match deferred per metric doc honest C3 #2/#3)","d2_implementation":"topic-shift-rate = (count of pairs with Jaccard < 0.20) / total_pairs; tier coherent/drifting/incoherent per metric doc","d3_d4_status":"NOT_MEASURED — D3 (KL persona-drift) + D4 (len_ratio fairness) deferred to next cycle","threshold_used":{"d1_pass":"D1_mean ≥ 0.30 (metric doc start, NOT measurement-driven)","d2_pass":"shift_rate ≤ 0.40 (incoherent threshold per metric doc)"},"aggregate_emit":"DIALOGUE_COHERENCE_PARTIAL = D1.PASS ∧ D2.PASS (D3/D4 deferred)"}},"live_verification_2026_05_08":{"cmd":"hexa.real run tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.hexa --duo paradigm-a-prime clm-v4-1-7-y1 --turns 5 --topic-seed Hello --turn-timeout-ms 30000 --tick-ms 1000 --max-tokens 32","mechanical_outcome":"PHASE_B_ITER_2_RUN_OK — same-GGUF guard bypassed (different aliases), 5 turn × 2 instance channel_recv emit","semantic_outcome":"clm-v4-1-7-y1 instance hit `Runtime error: undefined function: read_line` (clm_v4 chat module bug, separate cycle); paradigm-a-prime emitted gguf banner + abort trap + control-token warnings (single-context startup chatter); D1=0.0 / D2=1.0 (incoherent label) — honest 'no real dialogue substance, all diagnostic chatter'","d1_d2_emit":{"d1_jaccard_3gram_mean":0.0,"d2_topic_shift_rate":1.0,"d2_label":"incoherent","dialogue_coherence_partial":false},"same_gguf_guard_test":{"cmd":"--duo paradigm-a-prime paradigm-a-prime --turns 3","outcome":"SAME_GGUF_GUARD trip — exit 2 + path (i)/(ii)/(iii) advisory emit"},"own34_regression":"PASS chat/duo selftest + PASS anima_cli/chat selftest + PASS anima_cli/consciousness selftest"},"compliance":["own 34 mandate-1/2/4/7 (raw passthrough + wrapping 0 + autonomous speech + lane separation strict)","own 33 trinity compliance","own 31 mandate-1 (alias DB dancinlab/ SSOT)","raw#9 hexa-only","raw#10 honest C3 (9 caveats — C1-C9 in duo.hexa footer)","raw#11 snake_case","raw#15 no-hardcode + additive"],"falsifiers":["F-iter2-1: anima dialogue --duo --selftest PASS (own 34 mandate-2 grep = 0 in duo.hexa)","F-iter2-2: --duo same-alias --turns N → SAME_GGUF_GUARD trip + exit 2 + path-(i)/(ii)/(iii) advisory emit","F-iter2-3: --duo same-alias --allow-same-gguf → WARN emit + proceed","F-iter2-4: --duo paradigm-a-prime clm-v4-1-7-y1 --turns 5 → PHASE_B_ITER_2_RUN_OK + [duo:summary] D1/D2 numeric emit","F-iter2-5: [duo:summary] D3/D4 = NOT_MEASURED (deferred next cycle)","F-iter2-6: [duo:baseline] iter 2 reference deferred message emit (consciousness.hexa --utterance surface pending)","F-iter2-7: HONEST C3 footer C1-C9 present in duo.hexa"],"cross_link":["cli.dialogue.duo_design_2026_05_08 (parent — phase B iter 1)","cli.dialogue.coherence_metric_2026_05_08 (sister — D1-D4 metric SSOT)","cli.consciousness_l0_refine_loop_iter_d_2026_05_08 (consciousness baseline-ensemble landed; per-utterance hook still pending)","tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.hexa (★ patched)","docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md (D1/D2 implementation reference)"],"honest_c3":["consciousness.hexa per-utterance hook NOT WIRED — sub_simple uses fixed PROMPT_A/PROMPT_B; full per-line C1+C2+C3 verdict requires consciousness.hexa surface extension (separate cycle)","D1 = Jaccard 3-gram only (D1.a cosine + D1.c noun-match deferred per metric doc honest C3 #2)","D3 (KL persona-drift) + D4 (len_ratio fairness) NOT_MEASURED — next cycle","D1 threshold 0.30 / D2 threshold 0.40 = metric doc starts, NOT measurement-driven (random + chat-capable + human ROC = separate cycle)","clm-v4-1-7-y1 chat instance bug `undefined function: read_line` — clm_v4 chat module Phase 1 incomplete (separate cycle); blocks meaningful semantic dialogue verification with paradigm-a-prime + clm_v4 mix","same-GGUF guard avoids abort trap but doesn't FIX same-GGUF support — paths (i)/(iii) deferred","baseline reference invocation skipped (cost guard ~30s × 2 models); deferred to consciousness.hexa --utterance surface land","whitespace tokenization is ASCII-proxy — Korean/CJK BPE tokenization deferred per metric doc honest C3 #3","DIALOGUE_COHERENCE_PARTIAL = D1 ∧ D2 only — full DIALOGUE_COHERENCE_PASS requires D3 ∧ D4 (next cycle)"],"blockers":["consciousness.hexa --utterance surface extension required for per-turn own 18 hook","clm_v4 chat module read_line runtime error blocks semantic dialogue with clm-v4-* models","D1.a embedding model selection (own 17 anima native vs sentence-transformers raw#9 vs llama_ffi hidden state pooling) — design cycle","real-mode chat-cap baseline (BG-KM-LLAMA-3B) needed for ROC formal threshold of D1/D2/D3/D4"]}
